<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>There is a river,</l><l>The streams whereof make glad.</l><l>The city of God.</l><l>She shall not be moved.</l><l>God shall help her.</l><l>God’s in her midst.</l><l>They shall be abundantly satisfied</l><l>With the fatness of Thy house.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
